.TH geectl-build-list-binaries 1  "geectl-build-list-binaries 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-build\-list\-binaries \- List the built files for a package (or the whole repository)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl build list\-binaries\fR [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIREPOSITORY\fR> <\fIARCH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the built files for a package (or the whole repository)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
Only this package\*(Aqs files; without it, the whole repository\*(Aqs files
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package is in
.TP
<\fIREPOSITORY\fR>
The repository the files were built in
.TP
<\fIARCH\fR>
The architecture the files were built for
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
